    "statement": "Let H be the homogeneous gcd of the two parameter coefficients of B_src and h=deg H. Then B_src/H is a basepoint-free pencil inducing a degree D=R-1-h morphism phi:P^1_X->P^1_t, with H coprime to L_U0 and nonzero at x_*. Its center fibers are L_Mgamma Cbar_gamma. Their residual degrees are d-1-h,d-1-h,d-2-h; the residuals are pairwise coprime, and their locator products obey the unique nondegenerate three-term relation induced by evaluation of parameter-linear forms at the three centers. On U_0 the three fibers are exactly the three source classes, and phi(x_*) is not the large center.",
